ay:`Dlala ngokuthinta igolo`,tapToPlayHint:`Emdlalweni wesandla esisodwa: ukuthinta i-fret nakho kuzwakala inothi.`,multiNote:`Zonke izintambo ezithinta umunwe wakho`,multiNoteHint:`Umunwe ovala izintambo ezimbalwa, noma ushelelezi unqamule, uzicindezela zonke. Ngompompi ozowudlala, igudla intambo yentamo ngentambo.`,columnPress:`Cindezela ikholomu yonke`,columnPressHint:`Ukuthinta i-fret cindezela zonke izintambo kuleyo kholomu (barre). Ngokuthepha ukuze udlale, wonke amanothi afanele kulowo msindo wekholomu, noma iyiphi iyunithi yezinhlamvu oyithintayo.`,neckView:`Ukubuka kwentamo (isiginci nevayolini)`,hideNut:`Fihla ikholomu yochungechunge oluvulekile`,hideNutHint:`Ikhipha ikholomu yeyunithi yezinhlamvu evuleke kwesokunxele; lawo manothi asevele ewela emigqeni yezintambo kwesokudla. Ihlala lapho kuboniswa intamo kuphela.`,compactFrets:`Izingoma zodwa kuphela`,compactFretsHint:`Intamo ibonisa kuphela ama-frets ingoma ecindezelayo, namakholomu abanzi. Ama-frets eqiwe amakwe ngomugqa okabili.`,compactStrings:`Izintambo zengoma kuphela`,compactStringsHint:`Amayunithi ezinhlamvu ingoma engawadlali afihliwe, ukuze amanye abe made.`,fullNeck:`Intamo egcwele (all frets)`,fullNeckHint:`Intamo ayisaculi; konke ukukhathazeka kuze kufike kulowo owukhethayo imibukiso. Amanothi engoma asawela ezindaweni ezifanayo; ama-frets engeziwe awokudlala mahhala.`,neckFrets:`Ukukhathazeka kokugcina`,neckFretsHint:`Khetha ukuthi intamo iya kude kangakanani. Ama-frets amaningi enza amakholomu abe mncane.`,strikeZoneGuitar:`Ububanzi bendawo yezintambo — isiginci`,strikeZoneViolin:`Ububanzi bendawo yezintambo — ivayolini`,strikeZoneHint:`Inweba noma inciphise intambo (khetha / umnsalo) indawo engakwesokudla; ama-frets athatha okusele. I-100% ingusayizi ozenzakalelayo.`,handFocus:`Fihla enye ingxenye uma udlala ngesandla esisodwa`,handFocusHint:`Kumodi yesandla sokudla (i-auto fret) kuphela izintambo eziboniswayo, kwimodi engakwesokunxele (thepha ukuze udlale) kuphela entanyeni, kububanzi obugcwele.`,glideSection:`Imodi engenasici`,glideIntro:`Slayida umunwe wakho futhi iphimbo lishibilika kahle phakathi kwamanothi esikhundleni sokugxuma usuka kokhiye uye kokhiye.`,glidePiano:`Ipiyano engenantambo`,glidePianoHint:`Slayidela eceleni kokhiye obanjwayo ukuze ugobe iphimbo, njenge-synth. Ipiyano yangempela ayikwazi ukwenza lokhu, ngakho izwakala ingaphansi kwemvelo.`,glideGuitar:`Isiginci esingenamsindo`,glideViolin:`I-violin engenantambo`,glideTuning:`Ukushuna`,glideSnap:`Hlala kumanothi`,glideFree:`Mahhala`,glideSnapHint:`Bushelelezi ngenkathi ushelela; uma umunwe wakho usuphumule, iphimbo lihlala kunothi eliseduze.`,glideFreeHint:`Iphimbo lihlala lapho umunwe wakho ukhona, njengethuluzi langempela elingenamsindo; kungase kuphelelwe amandla.`,hideFrets:`Fihla ama-frets nemigqa eyisihluthulelo`,hideFretsHint:`Kwimodi engenamsindo isiginci neviolin kukhombisa intamo engenalutho futhi upiyano uba indawo eyodwa emhlophe; amanothi awayo asabonisa ukuthi kufanele kudlalelwe kuphi.`,hideKeysAsk:`Fihla okhiye futhi?`,hideKeysAskHint:`Ikhibhodi iba indawo eyodwa emhlophe ongayicindezela futhi uslayide noma yikuphi. Amanothi awayo asabonisa ukuthi kufanele adlale kuphi.`,hideFretsAsk:`Fihla imigqa ye-fret futhi?`,hideFretsAskHint:`Intamo ehluthukayo ayinakho ukucasuka. Amanothi awayo namachashazi asabonisa ukuthi uwubeke kuphi umunwe wakho.`,hideFretsYes:`Yebo, bafihle`,hideFretsKeep:`Zigcine`,midiInput:`MIDI ikhibhodi`,midiAll:`Wonke amadivayisi`,midiConnect:`Xhuma ikhibhodi MIDI`,midiUnsupported:`Lesi siphequluli asisekeli Web MIDI. Zama i-Chrome noma i-Edge.`,micListen:`Lalela ngombhobho`,micListenHint:`Dlala upiyano lwakho lwangempela, isiginci noma ivayolini; uhlelo lokusebenza luyizwa ngombhobho bese libhala amanothi. Isebenza kahle kakhulu ngemiculo enenothi elilodwa.`,micStart:`Qala ukulalela`,micStop:`Yeka ukulalela`,micListening:`Ukulalela`,micOn:`Imakrofoni ivuliwe. Dlala insimbi yakho yangempela. Sebenzisa ama-headphone ukuze umculo osekelayo ungaphazamisi, futhi uvale ukukhansela umsindo uma idivayisi yakho ivuliwe.`,micNoiseHint:`Ukukhanselwa komsindo kuthatha upiyano ukuze kuzwakale umsindo nokuyihlunga, ukuze amanothi aphuthelwe. Ivale uma ivuliwe: ku-iPhone, Control Center → Imodi ye-Mic → Okujwayelekile; ku-Android, ukuncishiswa komsindo kuzilungiselelo zomsindo; kukhompuyutha, izithuthukisi zomsindo wombhobho. Sebenzisa imakrofoni yedivayisi yakho kune-Bluetooth headset.`,micDenied:`Ukufinyelela kwemakrofoni kuvinjiwe. Ivumele kusiphequluli sakho noma izilungiselelo zefoni.`,micSensitivity:`Ukuzwela kwemakrofoni`,micSensitivityHint:`Phansi: amanothi adlalwe ngokuqinile kuphela. Phezulu: kuzwakala nokudlala okuthambile, kodwa kungase kube nomsindo.`,micSettings:`Izilungiselelo zemakrofoni`,micDevice:`Imakrofoni`,micDefault:`Imakrofoni ezenzakalelayo`,micDeviceN:`Imakrofoni {n}`,micLevelHint:`Ibha kufanele igcwale njengoba udlala. Uma kungakwenzi, phakamisa ukuzwela noma khetha omunye umbhobho.`,micDeviceFailed:`Lowo makrofoni awukwazanga ukuvulwa; kushintshelwe kwemisiwe.`,friends:`Abangane`,friendsTab:`Abangane`,boardTab:`Ibhodi lamasonto onke`,duelsTab:`Duel`,friendsPickName:`Khetha igama lomsebenzisi kuqala`,friendsPickNameHint:`Abangane bakuthole ngaleli gama. Ngeke ishintshwe kamuva.`,friendsYourName:`Igama lakho lomsebenzisi, abangani bakwengeza ngalo`,friendsInvite:`Mema`,friendsInviteTitle:`Yiba umngane wami ku-Sonatrio`,friendsInviteText:`Ngingeze ku-Sonatrio (@{name}) futhi masiqhudelane kubhodi yamasonto onke naku-duel!`,linkCopied:`Isixhumanisi sikopishiwe`,friendsAdd:`Engeza`,friendsAddPlaceholder:`Igama lomsebenzisi lomngane wakho`,friendRequestSent:`Isicelo sithunyelwe ku-@{name}`,friendAccepted:`Wena kanye no-@{name} seningabangani manje`,friendAlready:`@{name} usevele ungumngane wakho`,friendRequests:`Izicelo zobungane`,notifyFriendRequest:`@{name} ukuthumelele isicelo sobungani`,notifyFriendAccepted:`@{name} wamukele isicelo sakho sobungani`,notifyDuel:`@{name} ukuphonsele inselelo`,friend